sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant C   as Cliente
    participant G   as AuthGuard + RolesGuard
    participant RC  as RolesController
    participant RS  as RolesService
    participant DB  as PrismaService

    Note over G: Rol requerido: ADMIN
    Note over C,DB: Ver diagrama 02 para el flujo detallado de autenticación y autorización

    C->>G: GET /roles
    G-->>RC: request autorizado (user.roles incluye ADMIN)

    RC->>RS: getRoles()

    RS->>DB: role.findMany()
    DB-->>RS: Role[]

    RS-->>RC: Role[]
    RC-->>C: 200 { statusCode, message, data: Role[] }
